	"notes": "v3: title card, then the real loading screen and entrance (a screencast against `pnpm preview`, cut so the reveal lands on bar 4, where the groove starts), then v2 from bar 6 on the same grid, so synth.mjs runs unchanged. Looks may name a preset or an entry in `outfits` (t-shirt looks: the face reads; the arms keep the long-sleeve base and gloves). Letterbox from bar 6 (`letterboxFrom`). Times in bars (1 bar = 4 beats = 1.9355 s at 124 BPM). Hard cuts on the grid. The character's animation is ONE continuous timeline stepped 1/fps per frame across all cuts. The camera is set directly per frame (controls.setExternalCamera(true)): each section or bar lists camera keyframes {at (bar), pos [x,y,z], look [x,y,z], fov} interpolated with smoothstep between keyframes; a new keyframe set at a cut is a hard camera change. World: the figure stands at the origin, soles y = -0.9, head \u2248 0.75; the places are built for the -z half, so cameras stay at z > 0.6 and |x| < 2.4; keep look.y \u2265 0 unless noted so the head keeps air. Letterbox 2.39:1 is added in assembly (16:9 only), not in the frames. UI hidden in every scene frame. Looks: commuter, downpour, offshift, deckhand, basics, layered. Presets: dawn, noon, dusk, night. Places: harbor, rooftop, forest, dunes.",
